.worktrees/

# BRERC live-view attestation evidence. The raw capture contains internal SQL,
# database/role names and an object OID. Keep it in BRERC-controlled storage;
# commit only a reviewed, explicitly authorised approval artefact.
*.brerc-view-capture.json
*.brerc-view-definition.sql
*.brerc-view-approval.pending.json
*.brerc-view-approval.json
